{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.StandardModel.PolarizationRealStructure","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.StandardModel.PolarizationRealStructure","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic","lean:module:QOU.StandardModel.ChiralityPolarizationHopf"],"declarations":14,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Tetraplectic.hopf_dict_rotate","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Tetraplectic.hopf_dict_rotate","kind":"theorem","line":133,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/StandardModel/PolarizationRealStructure.lean#L133-L138","doc":"**The `λ`-dictionaries differ by a rotation**: the Hopf image of `v₁ + j ē² v₂` is\nthe conjugate by `e` of the Hopf image of `v₁ + j v₂`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Tetraplectic.dict_rotate","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Tetraplectic.dict_rotate","kind":"theorem","line":123,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/StandardModel/PolarizationRealStructure.lean#L123-L131","doc":"For a unit complex `e`, `e (v₁ + j v₂) = (v₁ + j ē² v₂) e`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Tetraplectic.realStr_unitK","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Tetraplectic.realStr_unitK","kind":"theorem","line":115,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/StandardModel/PolarizationRealStructure.lean#L115-L119","doc":"`u = k` negates the `i` and `j` parts: its fixed set is `span(1, k)`, the `λ = i`\ncircle (`pol a 0 0 d = a − d k`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Tetraplectic.realStr_unitJ","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Tetraplectic.realStr_unitJ","kind":"theorem","line":109,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/StandardModel/PolarizationRealStructure.lean#L109-L113","doc":"`u = j` negates the `i` and `k` parts: its fixed set is `span(1, j)`, the `λ = 1`\nreal polarizations `pol a 0 c 0`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Tetraplectic.realStr_involutive","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Tetraplectic.realStr_involutive","kind":"theorem","line":100,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/StandardModel/PolarizationRealStructure.lean#L100-L107","doc":"**An involution** for every unit `u = c j + d k`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Tetraplectic.star_orthW_mul_self","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Tetraplectic.star_orthW_mul_self","kind":"theorem","line":96,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/StandardModel/PolarizationRealStructure.lean#L96-L98","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Tetraplectic.orthW_mul_self","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Tetraplectic.orthW_mul_self","kind":"theorem","line":92,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/StandardModel/PolarizationRealStructure.lean#L92-L94","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Tetraplectic.realStr_antilinear","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Tetraplectic.realStr_antilinear","kind":"theorem","line":87,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/StandardModel/PolarizationRealStructure.lean#L87-L90","doc":"**Antilinear** for every `u = c j + d k`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Tetraplectic.realStr","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Tetraplectic.realStr","kind":"def","line":84,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/StandardModel/PolarizationRealStructure.lean#L84-L85","doc":"Conjugation by `u`: `p ↦ u p ū`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Tetraplectic.hopf_rightJ_no_fixed","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Tetraplectic.hopf_rightJ_no_fixed","kind":"theorem","line":70,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/StandardModel/PolarizationRealStructure.lean#L70-L80","doc":"**The antipodal map fixes no point** of the sphere, when `2` is cancellable. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Tetraplectic.hopf_rightJ","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Tetraplectic.hopf_rightJ","kind":"theorem","line":66,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/StandardModel/PolarizationRealStructure.lean#L66-L68","doc":"**On `S²`, `R_j` is the antipodal map.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Tetraplectic.rightJ_sq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Tetraplectic.rightJ_sq","kind":"theorem","line":62,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/StandardModel/PolarizationRealStructure.lean#L62-L64","doc":"**`R_j² = −1`**: a quaternionic structure, not a real one. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Tetraplectic.rightJ_antilinear","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Tetraplectic.rightJ_antilinear","kind":"theorem","line":57,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/StandardModel/PolarizationRealStructure.lean#L57-L60","doc":"**`R_j` is antilinear** for the Reeb complex structure: `R_j (p i) = −(R_j p) i`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Tetraplectic.rightJ","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Tetraplectic.rightJ","kind":"def","line":54,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/StandardModel/PolarizationRealStructure.lean#L54-L55","doc":"Right multiplication by `j`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}